      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So i keep having this same problem where people cant see me when i join. Sometimes only few can and other times no one or everyone can.. idk how to fix this. \nAnd no i do not mean just the avatar, i mean everything, username and avatar and cant hear me either. I constantly have to reload the world ot leave and join back or sometimes even restart the game. Its really annoying and i have to constantly ask people if they can see me. And sometimes when i talk to a friend (if they can see me) others sometimes say who are you talking to. And when playing games like murder four, i get kicked because my character is “invisible” and claimed as hacking. I need this fixed",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
