      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While this is highly upvoted and being worked on, I'd like to take the opportunity to plug another related issue (see my last comment on it, not issue text): https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1095-avatars-with-chairs-cause-players-to-be-stuck-on-spawnorigin-for-late-joine\nTLDR is that an avatar with enough chairs and index controllers will make you appear frozen to remote users, so you can roam the world freely and listen in on conversations, while being completely invisible and inaudible (because you're stuck frozen on spawn for remote players).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "60db401f6cba21439bfbda94",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f68d1d49110d77be7e5bcc9",
        "alias": "Large Chimpanzee",
        "aliasID": "65c2ce8bed6eefce4c1e37ca",
