        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/f77ef6482aefb4f9922b627a62958af8.png",
        "created": "2020-09-21T16:16:20.509Z",
        "name": "ReploidSham",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "reploidsham"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62f2b3cf8f8367753b2f0",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2021-06-29T15:45:35.971Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "609cb1f2fb46f007a137c6b1",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Certain worlds tend to invoke it constantly. A good example is the TonboBattleField. You may need 10+ users to trigger in, but it's intermittent and affects certain people. I noticed targeting when and setting hide and show avatar can fix it after they disappear, but when you're playing a game world, that can be terrible. It doesn't seem to affect Lasertag as much but I've seen it happen there.\nWhen it comes to private convos, though. Really, assume you're never save, take it to invite only.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
