      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Out of curiosity, how many people have observed this _directly_ lately in Live? Please don't telephone game reports-- I'm interested in verifiable, definite \"Yes, I couldn't see this person until I muted/unmuted someone else\" reports.\nI haven't heard or seen any further reports of this issue and I think we might've squashed it with some other, related changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
