  "details": "At unpredictable times, players will disappear completely in an instance, not be visible, have a name plate, make any audio, appear on the social list, and apparently won't have any local simulation data associated with them.\nBeyond the obvious frustration and confusion that this causes, it causes a somewhat significant lack of confidence for personal privacy.\nIt becomes difficult to be assured of who is and is not present and listening to private conversations. Please address this.",
